# Go (hub rule)

Prefer **explicit errors**, **synchronous APIs** unless concurrency is intrinsic, **small consumer-defined interfaces**, **concrete return types**, **`context.Context` as the first parameter** when cancellation/deadlines apply, and **feature-oriented packages** (`internal/` for unstable implementation).

Tests: when editing `*_test.go`, follow **`go-testing.mdc`** alongside this rule.

